{title: Sent Forth by God's Blessing}
{key: C}
{time: 3/4}

{start_of_verse: 1}
Sent [C]forth by God's [**]blessing, our [Dm]true faith con[G]fessing
The [C]people of [F]God from this [G]dwelling take [C]leave
The [C]service is [**]ended, O [Dm]now be ex[G]tended
The [C]fruits of our [F]worship in [G]all who be[C]lieve.

The [C]seed of the [G]teaching, re[**]ceptive souls [C]reaching
Shall [C]blossom in [F]action for [D]God and for [G]all.

God's [C]grace did in[**]vite us, and [Dm]love shall u[G]nite us
To [C]work for God's [F]kingdom and [G]answer the [C]call.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 2}
With [C]praise and thanks[**]giving to [Dm]God, ever[G]living
The [C]tasks of our [F]everyday [G]life we will [C]face
Our [C]faith ever [**]sharing, in [Dm]love ever [G]caring
Em[C]bracing God's [F]children of [G]each tribe and [C]race.

With [C]your grace you [G]feed us, with [**]your light now [C]lead us
U[C]nite us as [F]one in the [D]life that we [G]share.

Then [C]may all the [**]living, with [Dm]praise and thanks[G]giving
Give [C]honour to [F]Christ and that [G]name which we [C]bear.
{end_of_verse}
